# Deploy

Apply this rule manually for deployment and environment work. Authoritative pipeline map: [`docs/CI_CD.md`](../../docs/CI_CD.md), [`DEPLOYMENT.md`](../../DEPLOYMENT.md), [`docs/PRODUCTION_DEPLOYMENT_RUNBOOK.md`](../../docs/PRODUCTION_DEPLOYMENT_RUNBOOK.md).

## Checklist
- Staging deploys automatically on push to `main` / `master`. Production is gated (environment protection, confirm phrase, compliance). See `docs/CI_CD.md`.
- NEVER automatic restore to production. Validation restore uses an isolated DB (`restore_validation_*`) and dual Super Admin approval.
- Tenant hard-delete is disabled in production; use soft-delete (archive) for tenant removal.
- Super Admin cache clear (`POST /api/admin/cache/clear`) is for emergencies or after database migrations / manual DB fixes — not for routine deploys.
- Do not enable `Fiscal.KassenSicherheitDe` or `QrRechnung:BankSubmit` for a real tenant until `docs/COUNTRIES.md` §16 marks that package production-ready.
- Encrypt secrets in `appsettings.Production.json`. Do not commit secrets.

## Production hosts

| Surface | URL |
|---------|-----|
| POS UI | `https://pos.regkasse.at` |
| FA UI | `https://admin.regkasse.at` |
| API | `https://api.regkasse.at` |

One shared POS UI for all tenants. Production API traffic is scoped by JWT `tenant_id`. Do not use `X-Tenant-Id` or `?tenant=` in Production.

## Development URLs

```text
POS UI:     http://localhost:8081
FA UI:      http://admin.regkasse.local:3000
API:        http://localhost:5184
```

### Environment Variables

Backend:
```env
ASPNETCORE_ENVIRONMENT=Development
ConnectionStrings__DefaultConnection=Host=localhost;Database=kasse_db;Username=postgres;Password=***
JwtSettings__SecretKey=*** (min 32 chars)
```

Frontend Admin:
```env
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:5184
NEXT_PUBLIC_RKSV_ENVIRONMENT=TEST
```

Frontend POS:
```env
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=http://192.168.1.100:5184/api
EXPO_PUBLIC_DEV_TENANT_ID=dev
# Production target: EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=https://api.regkasse.at/api
# (single POS UI — see docs/POS_PRODUCTION_ARCHITECTURE.md)
```

Frontend Sites:
```env
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:5184
```


## Backup configuration

### Backup Configuration
```yaml
enabled: true
scheduleCron: "0 2 * * *"  # Daily 02:00 UTC (System strategy)
retentionDays: 30           # Tenant default; System default 90 via strategy policy
# SmartRetentionEnabled: false  # optional GFS 7/4/12/7 via SmartRetentionService
# StorageTierManagementEnabled: false
# AutomaticCleanupEnabled: false
executionMode: "PgDump"     # Fake, PgDump, ProductionStub
externalArchiveRoot: "/backup/archive"  # Super Admin only
```
